e Officer"},{"text":"Conflict Resolution Programme Associate"},{"text":"Community Engagement Specialist"}]}]},{"heading":"AI & Future of Community Leadership — 2030–2045","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI will increasingly support community organisations with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Beneficiary data analysis"},{"text":"Programme planning"},{"text":"Survey analysis"},{"text":"Translation"},{"text":"Community feedback analysis"},{"text":"Volunteer scheduling"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Impact reporting"},{"text":"Donor reporting"},{"text":"Communication personalisation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Community Feedback","Data Collection","AI-assisted Analysis","Programme Insights","Human Leadership Decision","Intervention","Impact Measurement"]},{"type":"p","text":"However, community leadership will continue to depend heavily on trust, empathy, cultural understanding, ethical judgement and human relationships."},{"type":"p","text":"AI cannot replace legitimate community participation and human accountability."}]},{"heading":"Future-Proof Skill Combination","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest profile will be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Theology/Religious Studies","Community Development","Project Management","Social Research","M&E","Data","Digital Communication"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"An especially useful combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Religious Studies","Social Impact","M&E","Power BI","Project Management","Conflict Resolution"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This allows the graduate to work beyond traditional religious institutions in the wider development and social-impact sector."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Paths","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BA Theology/Religious Studies graduate can also pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community Coordinator"},{"text":"NGO Programme Officer"},{"text":"Social Worker"},{"text":"Development Professional"},{"text":"Youth Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Outreach Coordinator"},{"text":"Volunteer Coordinator"},{"text":"Community Development Officer"},{"text":"Social Impact Associate"},{"text":"Programme Manager"},{"text":"Religious Studies Researcher"},{"text":"Theology Research Assistant"},{"text":"Faith-Based Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Interfaith Dialogue Coordinator"},{"text":"Peacebuilding Associate"},{"text":"Humanitarian Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Education Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"CSR Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Social Research Assistant"},{"text":"Public Policy Research Assistant"},{"text":"Community Engagement Specialist"}]}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"h","text":"Academic"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theology/religious studies"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Sociology"},{"text":"Philosophy"},{"text":"Religion and society"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Community"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Needs assessment"},{"text":"Community mobilisation"},{"text":"Stakeholder engagement"},{"text":"Volunteer management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project planning"},{"text":"Budgeting"},{"text":"Event management"},{"text":"Programme implementation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Monitoring & evaluation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Digital"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Canva"},{"text":"Basic databases/CRM"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"Facilitation"},{"text":"Conflict resolution"},{"text":"Team management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Experience"},{"type":"p","text":"Ideally:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"1–2 NGO/community internships"},{"text":"100+ meaningful volunteer hours"},{"text":"1–2 independently led community projects"},{"text":"1 community needs assessment"},{"text":"1 impact dashboard"},{"text":"A documented programme-impact report"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Quality and genuine contribution matter more than simply accumulating hours."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"flow","items":["BA Theology / Religious Studies","Year 1: Theology + ethics + sociology + communication","Year 2: Community development + social research + project planning","Year 3: Leadership + M&E + fundraising + Power BI","Volunteer with NGOs/community organisations","Lead a real community-development project","Community Outreach / Programme Assistant / Community Coordinator","Community Programme Officer","Community Leader / Programme Manager","Senior Programme Manager / Community Development Manager","Head of Programmes / Community Development Leadership"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best long-term combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Theology/Religious Studies","Community Development","Social Work/Development Studies","Project Management","Monitoring & Evaluation","Data Analytics","Conflict Resolution","Digital/AI Skills"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this career, leadership must be demonstrated through real community work. A student who combines theological understanding with measurable community-project experience, programme management and data-driven impact evaluation will have a much stronger career profile than someone relying on the degree alone."}]}]}